    "site_desc": "The study site is in the southwest corner of the Encanto Golf Course in Phoenix, Arizona. The site is in a vehicle parking lot next to Encanto Boulevard, about 500 m south of another eddy covariance site within Encanto Golf Course (US-Px2). The soil is well-drained Mohall clay loam but is overlain by asphalt. The low-density urban landscape surrounding the golf park consists of single-family residences, commercial areas, streets, and parking lots.",
